@startuml
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Student\n(SwiftUI)" as App
participant "FastAPI\nBackend" as API
database "PostgreSQL\nDB" as DB
participant "R Plumber\n(Transport)" as Plumber
participant "R Domain\nPackages" as RCore
participant "SMARD\nExternal API" as SMARD

== Flow A: Synchronous Mobile Recommendation Read & Check-In ==
App -> API : GET /api/v1/recommendations/{user_id}
API -> DB : SELECT ranked habits & clean windows
DB --> API : Cached recommendation rows
API --> App : 200 OK (JSON Habit Cards)

App -> API : POST /api/v1/checkins (habit_id, completed=true)
API -> DB : INSERT check-in + CO2 savings
DB --> API : Check-in confirmed
API --> App : 201 Created (Updated CO2 total)

== Flow B: Asynchronous Nightly Batch Pipeline (Green Software Pattern) ==
API -> Plumber : POST /batch/recompute (Internal Trigger)
activate Plumber
Plumber -> RCore : run_nightly_pipeline()
activate RCore

RCore -> SMARD : GET /app/chart_data/1223/...
SMARD --> RCore : Hourly generation JSON

RCore -> DB : Read users, checkins, commitments
DB --> RCore : Training & profile datasets

RCore -> RCore : Run forecast/fable (ARIMA/ETS/STL), recommenderlab(), arules()
RCore -> DB : UPSERT grid_intensity & recommendations
RCore --> Plumber : BatchSummary(status="success", rows_updated)
deactivate RCore

Plumber --> API : 200 OK (Serialized JSON summary)
deactivate Plumber
@enduml